data: {"id": "0e73f9100a11479f-final", "run_id": "0e73f9100a11479f", "seq": 693, "ts_ms": 1788801891160, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，重启 13 次 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: OOMKilled | 确定容器终止的直接原因为内存超限 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_exit_code`: 137 | 验证 OOMKilled 产生的标准退出码 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory`: 64Mi | 锁定被触发硬限制的内存上限阈值 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Back-off restarting failed container app` (x197 over 55m) | 记录因 CrashLoopBackOff 导致的高频重启现象 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason`: 1 (reason=OOMKilled) | 独立于 K8s API 的指标证据，确证 OOMKilled 状态 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`: 13 | 量化故障发生的频次 |\n| 7 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `memory allocation advanced` 日志模式，`allocated_mib` 从 14.0 增至 48.0 | 观察应用运行时内存分配持续增长的行为 |\n\n**证据印证说明**：Kubernetes 的 OOMKilled 状态与 Prometheus 的 OOMKilled 指标相互印证，确证了内核 OOM Killer 介入的事实；同时，日志中 `allocated_mib` 的递增趋势（至 48Mi）与 64Mi 的 Limit 形成明确的因果关联，解释了为何会触发硬限制。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器 Memory Limit (64Mi) 设置过小 → 应用运行分配内存超过 Limit → 触发 OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) → Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**容器内存限制配置过低 (64Mi)，无法支撑应用运行时的实际内存分配需求**。\n\n证据表明，应用在运行过程中内存分配持续增长（日志记录分配值最高达到 48Mi），逼近并触发了 64Mi 的硬限制（证据 3、7）。内核 OOM Killer 介入导致容器以 Exit Code 137 退出（证据 1、2），并被 Prometheus 指标（证据 5）独立确认。高频的 CrashLoopBackOff 事件（证据 4）和重启计数（证据 6）均是这一机制的后续表现。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 67.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr: 67.3s (Evidence 59.1s, RCA 8.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 94.448, "metrics": {"run_id": "0e73f9100a11479f", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 94.45471477508545, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 94454.71477508545, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 64749.603271484375, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 4, "tool_duration_ms": 37947.12257385254, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 29331.75277709961}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18210.81590652466, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 67328.78875732422, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8894.935369491577, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

